The survey schema includes current `life_stage` plus yearly `annual_spend` totals, but no records or precomputed statistics are available here. The requested gaps (max minus min annual vehicle spend, by stage) therefore cannot be calculated or ranked.

To obtain the answer from the actual 10 000-household file one would:
- map each household-year’s `total_usd` to the household’s contemporaneous life stage (using the life-timeline events to reconstruct stage at that year, because the stored `life_stage` field is only the 2026 snapshot);
- for each of the six stages compute the observed min and max of those annual totals;
- report the stage whose max–min difference is largest, stating the denominator (household-years or households) used.

No such numbers can be supplied from the schema alone.
